<title>JAPAN: Kawatetsu Galvan - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kawatetsu Galvan - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 17.44		vs	   18.44</p>
<p> Operating	  195    million    vs	  111    million</p>
<p> Current	    206    million    vs	   62    million</p>
